# Nephtys Configuration
# Copy to .env and customize.
#
# `make run` exports this file before starting the binary. Nothing else does:
# the binary reads the process environment only, so `go run ./cmd/nephtys`,
# systemd units and container runtimes need these supplied directly.

# NATS broker URL
NATS_URL=nats://localhost:4222

# REST API port
NEPHTYS_PORT=3002

# Bearer token for API authentication. Leaving it unset disables the
# stream-management routes entirely — they answer 403, not 401 — so set it
# before calling anything under /v1/streams.
# NEPHTYS_ADMIN_TOKEN=

# Log level (debug, info, warn, error)
NEPHTYS_LOG_LEVEL=info

# --- compose stack only (not read by the binary) ---

# Shared secret between Grafana and the image renderer. Grafana refuses to start
# the rendering service if this is left at its built-in default, so the compose
# stack supplies one; override it if you expose the stack beyond localhost.
# GF_RENDERER_TOKEN=nephtys-local-dev
